	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Cum primum cardinales convenissent quadraginta <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>plus uno in primo et 2° scrutinio, id est semel iterumque a suffragiis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>26. in pontificem designatus fuit <persName>Reginaldus Polus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quem <persName ref="p4757">Farnesius</persName> et <persName>Caesariani</persName> cupiebant.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Huic vero election<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>i cum non assentirentur reliqui, protinus surrexit <persName ref="p4757">Farnesius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et simul <persName>Tridentinus</persName>, quasi illum reverenter exosculaturi, arbitrati <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nimirum sequuturos omnes approbaturosque electionem, utpote <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quę impediri ultra nequiret.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">At <placeName>Ferrarienis</placeName>, <placeName>Tranus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>et <placeName>Theatinus</placeName> sese fortiter opposuerunt asseverantes <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>intrepide, cum haud legitime fuerit electus, ipsos excommunicato<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>s pronunciari a canonibus, si pergant ad adorationem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Postera mane adhuc contendentibus ipsis ecce regius orator <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>cum literis <placeName ref="l378">Parisiensis</placeName> cardinalis, quas portaverat veredarius, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>qui Gallos cardinales in Spezię portu se reliquisse et mox <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>adfuturos sancte iurabat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Hoc nuntio accepto turbata sunt omnia.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Sic dies ille periit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Postridie, qui fuit 12. decembris, quatuor ap<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>pulerunt ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallis</placeName> illis, nempe <persName>Ghisa</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Belay, Va d'- homo et Sciatiglion<note type="margin">dazu a.R. v. <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand: "<persName>Schattilion</persName>"</note>, quii conclave confestim <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ingressi supersedendum negotiumque tanti momenti haud praecipitandum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>esse contendebant, donec sub vesperam adveniente Torinensi aequilibrium <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>factum est tale, ut papam non ita brevi simus habituri<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> quidem proponunt Tranum, <persName>Theatinum</persName>, Salviatum, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName>Rodolphum Montem</persName> et S. Crucis cardinalem; verum imperia<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>les a<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tque <persName ref="p4757">Farnesii</persName> perstant in sententia prim<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>a, Anglum, non alium, volunt admissuri nunquam S. Crucis et de Monte cardinales etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Caeter<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>a hic quietissime habent etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l425">Romę</placeName> 28. decembris<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
